{"id":"n38216-3-4","stage":3,"title":"꽂히다 · 盯","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38216-3-4-1","ko":"무슨 사진을 그렇게 오래 봐요?","zh":"你怎么看那张照片看这么久啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"사진을","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진을","audio":"/audio/3394e235d3ed53a58eaf.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"오래","meaning":"好久，很久","explanation":"오래：好久，很久","readings":[{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57308","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"}},{"text":"봐요?","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐요","audio":"/audio/fc7dc158d915635d6cbc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","au